 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Game Chishiki de Saikyou ni Natta Mob Heishi wa, Shin no Jitsuryoku wo Kakushitai"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "ゲーム知識で最強に成ったモブ兵士は、真の実力を隠したい"
   },
   {
    "en": "The Mob Soldier Who Became the Strongest with His Game Knowledge Wants to Hide His True Strength"
   },
   {
    "id": "Aku Hanya Prajurit Kroco yang Jadi OP Berkat Pengetahuan Game, Tapi Harus Pura-pura Lemah"
   },
   {
    "ja-ro": "Game Chishiki de Saikyou ni Natta Mob Heishi wa, Shin no Jitsuryoku wo Kakushitai"
   },
   {
    "es-la": "El Portero que se Convirtió en el Más Fuerte Gracias a su Conocimiento de Juegos Quiere Ocultar su Verdadero Poder"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "One day, Sylva realized that he reincarnated into a mob soldier from the game that he was hooked on in his previous life. Even though he utilizes his game knowledge to do his utmost best to survive in this dangerous world, he opts to hide his true strength in order not to throw the scenario into disarray.\n\nHowever, an unexpected turn of events led him to easily defeat a powerful demon that even the hero is hard-pressed to defeat. And to make matters worse, he did that in front of his favorite heroine in the game... Upon this incident, word started getting out about his true strength...!\n\nA heroic fantasy about the strongest soldier who will bring his full strength to bear for the sake of his favorite character is about to unfold!",
   "ja": "門兵として働く、しがないモブ兵士――実は最強の兵士だった！？\nある日、シルヴァは生前ドはまりしていたゲーム内のモブ兵士へ転生したことに気づく。\n危険な世界で身を守るために、ゲーム知識を使って最強に至るも、シナリオを乱さないために真の実力を隠していた。\nしかし、ひょんなことから勇者でも苦戦する強大な魔族を、あっさりと斬り倒してしまう。\nしかも、推しヒロインの目の前で……。この事件を契機に彼の実力は次第に知れ渡ってしまい――！？\n推しのために、最強のモブ兵士が実力を発揮するヒロイックファンタジー！開幕！"
  },
